OL,3,ADavey promises tax cuts for millions if
OL,4,AUK rejoins EU single market
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liberal Democrats will fight the
OL,7,Fnext general election on a promise to
OL,8,Fcut taxes for millions of workers, Sir
OL,9,FEd Davey has said in a speech to his
OL,10,Fparty conference.
OL,12,FThe Lib Dem leader said that if he
OL,13,Fgained power, he would raise the annual
OL,14,Ftax-free personal allowance to #15,000.
OL,16,FHe would also raise the 40p income tax
OL,17,Fthreshold from #50,270 to #56,000, in a
OL,18,F#17bn package funded by the economic
OL,19,Fboost he says would come from the UK
OL,20,Frejoining the EU single market and
OL,21,Fcustoms union.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
