OL,3,ADeveloping El Nino becomes strongest on
OL,4,Arecord weeks before expected peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developing El Nino climate
OL,7,Fphenomenon is now the strongest on
OL,8,Frecord, according to scientists
OL,9,Fmonitoring Pacific Ocean temperatures.
OL,11,FDaily sea surface temperatures in a key
OL,12,Fregion of the central-eastern Pacific
OL,13,Fwere 3.05C above average on 19
OL,14,FSeptember - exceeding the previous
OL,15,Frecord of 3.02C set during the very
OL,16,Fstrong El Nino of 2015.
OL,18,FSome longer-term measures of El Nino
OL,19,Fhave not yet hit record levels but this
OL,20,Fis likely to change, with the peak not
OL,21,Fexpected until later this year.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
