OL,3,ADeveloping El Nino becomes strongest on
OL,4,Arecord weeks before expected peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl Nino can cause major shifts in
OL,7,Fweather patterns around the world, with
OL,8,Fthe Met Office saying many of the
OL,9,Fexpected impacts are already being
OL,10,Ffelt.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
