OL,3,AEleven injured in shooting outside
OL,4,ATurkish school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect's mother, father, and
OL,7,Fgrandfather - who reportedly owned the
OL,8,Fweapon - have also been detained,
OL,9,Faccording to the country's justice
OL,10,Fminister AkD1n Gurlek.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
